// Article 7. Amendment.
#require "2-decisions.charter".
Fact amendment
Use poll(amendment) As amendment

Clause 7.1 Approved "19139fb73f932f50fba03418c53e3dff6d76b5cc4a220db4efa74a86a7110599"
  Norm "This agreement may be amended only by members holding at least three quarters of the percentage interests." => amendment-vote
  Norm " An amendment made without that vote has no effect." => first-amendment
.
